ld-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the McDonald County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 32% of normal in November to December and 161% in April to May. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grids 20242 and 20243 down at 47% that year.</p>"}
